</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lilymarie<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, March 05, 2005 - 10:43 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Singing like a caged bird...lame yet somewhat tragic.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10657-->
<!--Post: 10660--><!--Time: 1110093274-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10660"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Chiquitah<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Chiquitah<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, March 05, 2005 - 11:14 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->The whole thing is definately a tragedy. <BR> <BR>..... I can name that tune in 3 notes: B T K.....<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10660-->
<!--Post: 10662--><!--Time: 1110094290-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10662"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lostdog<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lostdog<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, March 05, 2005 - 11:31 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Legal eagles… if this is not a rumor what happens next? <BR> <BR>How soon will the victims survivors have THEIR day in court? <BR> <BR>Will the confessions be made public? <BR> <BR>The WE article and previous leaks insinuate that DCK has been singing since Friday last… <BR> <BR>…Hence, the bizarre behavior and language at Saturday’s press conference. <BR> <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10662-->
<!--Post: 10665--><!--Time: 1110103067-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10665"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:embersageblue@aol.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Embersage<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, March 06, 2005 - 1:57 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->If you get a chance go to vics. and look at the rader travel time line, see who else might pop up belonging to Rader Thanks for the info LD<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10665-->
<!--Post: 10675--><!--Time: 1110129878-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10675"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Rocky<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Rocky<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, March 06, 2005 - 9:24 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Lostdog: and as my family respected the Hedge family, we did not give any interviews as well. I must tell you one of the funniest things we ever saw, was the reporter from Channel 12 making a bee line to our house after the neighbors told her we knew Marine - that was the fastest I have ever seen a woman walk in high heels only to greet a &#34;No Comment&#34;! HA!  <BR> <BR>As for the legal stuff, I can only speculate based on past experience - I&#39;m sure that defense counsel has filed numerous motions to supress the confessions, and any evidence seized to this point and anything else that fall under the 4th,5th, and 6th Amendments. For sure the motion for change of venue! God I hope they read him his miranda rights!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10675-->
<!--Post: 10687--><!--Time: 1110138244-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10687"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Verm_inve<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Verm_inve<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->8-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, March 06, 2005 - 11:44 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Rocky:  Please tell me she was in high heels <IMG SRC="http://www.catchbtk.com/discus/clipart/happy.gif" ALT=":-&#41;" BORDER=0> <BR> <BR>Am I right that the police have no responded to this rumor yet?  Thus indicating its truthfulness?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10687-->
